  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "comment": "*Sterilize separately by filtration."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "comment": "Mix ingredients except ethyl alcohol. Dispense the medium into suitable culture vessels under a stream of nitrogen gas, seal with butyl rubber stoppers, and autoclave at 121°C for 15 min. Aseptically and anaerobically add ethyl alcohol using sterile syringes."
    }
  ]
